+# WoW Map Asset Parser

-A command line utility to extract and package assets for WOTLK (3.3.5) maps.
+A command line utility to extract and package assets for World of Warcraft
+pre-Cataclysm maps.

-This reads ADT files to identify the assets in use and then selectively
-package only the needed data.
+Supports all monolithic (pre-Cataclysm) ADT files:
+- **Vanilla** (1.12.x)
+- **TBC** (2.4.3)
+- **WotLK** (3.3.5a)
+
+All three versions use the same ADT v18 format with identical MMDX, MWMO,
+MTEX, MDDF, and MODF chunk layouts.  The parser reads these chunks by
+scanning for their magic bytes, so no version-specific handling is needed.

 ## Requirements

-Compatible with WOTLK version 3.3.5 only.
-
 Requires unpacked data files (external to MPQ archives).

+The M2 and WMO binary formats read by this tool (texture lookup tables,
+MODN/MOTX/MOMT chunks) are also identical across Vanilla, TBC, and WotLK.
+
